# The build context of Dockerfile.app. Docker reads this file instead of
# .dockerignore for that Dockerfile. Same allowlist approach: deny everything,
# allow only what Dockerfile.app COPYs.
#
# A re-included directory comes back whole, so everything under it that is
# runtime data or a local artefact is excluded again after it -- later lines win.
*

!bin
!montrek
!requirements.in
!requirements.txt
montrek/uploads
montrek/sent_emails
montrek/reporting/.workbench
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.coverage
**/.scannerwork
**/node_modules

# Extensions checked out into a dev tree stay out of a core image. A client
# build assembles its own context with its extensions under montrek/ and
# replaces this file with one that leaves out this line.
montrek/mt_*
